title: Desert_1
---
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: Wait... Do I have a weapon in my hand? How did it get there?
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: It has always been there, Bob. You are on a mission, remember.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: A mission? I don't remember anything... I just know I have to get out of here.
<<hide_portrait>>
===
title: Desert_2
---
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: Why are you moving so fast? Are you running from something?
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: I'm heading towards the light. That's the exit. I have to leave this place.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: What if the exit isn't over there? Look around you.
<<hide_portrait>>
===
title: Desert_3
---
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: These buildings... Why is everything on fire? It's hell in here.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: Fire purifies, Bob. Or perhaps it erases traces.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: What are you talking about? I'm a secret agent, I save people! I don't set cities on fire!
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: An agent? Really? Or is that what you tell yourself to endure the sound of the flames?
<<hide_portrait>>
===
title: Desert_4
---
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: You're starting to recognize this place, aren't you?
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: Shut up! I'm not listening to you! I'm reaching that door and this will all be over.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: Running won't change what happened. The civilians, Bob... Do you hear them?
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: STOP! LEAVE ME ALONE!
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: I... I feel heavy... The heat... I can't take it anymore... My vision is blurring...
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: It's not the heat crushing you. It's the weight of guilt.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: I just want to go home... forget all this.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Unknown">>
????: Forgetting has only led you here. It's time to wake up, Bob.
<<hide_portrait>>
===
title: Desert_5
---
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: ...
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob">>
Bob: I... I can't... I can't... I can't...
<<hide_portrait>>
===
title: Desert_Ending
---
<<show_portrait "Doctor">>
Doctor: Medical log update. Subject is still unresponsive to the simulation.
Doctor: Bob, listen to me. This "secret agent" life... it's a fantasy you built to escape the trauma.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob_hp">>
Bob: ...
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Doctor">>
Doctor: You were a soldier. In the army. The mission wasn't to save the world.
Doctor: You opened fire on civilians during that mission. That is the truth.
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Bob_hp">>
Bob: ...
<<hide_portrait>>
<<show_portrait "Doctor">>
Doctor: You killed them, Bob. And until you accept that, you will never leave this hospital.
<<hide_portrait>>
===
